    "name": "Messenger API",
    "description": "### Minimal Messenger API\n\nThis collection demonstrates the complete workflow for the Lab 2 Messenger API, including strict relational entity creation and message persistence.\n\n**Included Endpoints:**\n1. **Create User:** Generates a new user and returns their UUID.\n2. **Create Conversation:** Initializes a new chat and returns its UUID.\n3. **Send Message:** Posts a message (requires valid User and Conversation IDs).\n4. **Retrieve History:** Fetches all non-deleted messages for a conversation.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54617437"
  },
